Rule 1 (primitive type variable should not be zero)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≠ 0
>>
Rule 2 (tensor parameter should have valid shape)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (tensor parameter should have valid dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= -1 × ndim(v_1) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 ≤ ndim(v_1) - 1
>>
Rule 6 (tensor parameter should be compatible with other tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, 0)
>>
Rule 8 (index tensor (v_3) is within the input tensor along the specified dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : tensor} |= min(v_3) ≥ 0 ∧ max(v_3) ≤ shape(v_1, v_2) - 1
>>
Rule 9 (index tensor (v_2) should be within the range of input tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= min(v_2) ≥ 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : max(v_2) ≤ shape(v_1, i) - 1
>>
Rule 20 (tensor parameter should be of type bool)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = bool
>>
Rule 21 (tensor parameter should be of type str)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = str
